<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>knot setup complete</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: dark; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
    margin: 0; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6;
    background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0;
  }
  .card { max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto; background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1.75rem; }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem; }
  code { background: #334155; padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 0.2rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; }
  pre { background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; overflow-x: auto; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; color: #93c5fd; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <h1>Configuration written</h1>
  <p>Saved to <code>{{ .Path }}</code>.</p>
  <p style="margin:1rem 0 0.5rem">Start the server:</p>
  <pre>knot server</pre>
  <p style="margin-top:1rem;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.85rem">On first launch the web UI will prompt you to create the initial admin user.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
